<%# The figure of the error pages (wrong), engraved by Score's own engraver
    and kept as it drew it: no engine, no database, no script at request time
    (a 5xx page must not lean on what may have failed). C, E, G, then F sharp and G together, accented: a wrong note.
    Its source, drawn again with ScoreSvg.draw(source, 320, 7, 0, {}) when the
    engraver's drawing changes:
      \relative c' { \time 4/4 c4 e g <fis' g>\accent \bar "|." } -%>
